<%args>
  $organism
</%args>
<& /page/page_title.mas, title => '<i>'.$organism->species.'</i> 基因組數據(Genome Data)' &>

<div class="page_introduction">

   馬鈴薯基因組由來自 14 個國家的國際科學家小組組成的<a
   href="http://potatogenome.net">馬鈴薯基因組定序聯盟(Potato Genome Sequence
   Consortium)</a> (PGSC) 完成定序。該序列於 2011 年 7 月發表在 <a
   href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21743474">Nature</a> 上。許多馬鈴薯品係是四倍體；然而，定序的種質是純合二倍體品系（雙單倍體）<i>Solanum
   tuberosum phureja</i>。以下是 <a href="http://potatogenome.net">http://potatogenome.net</a> 上提供的檔案鏡像。(The potato genome has been sequenced by the <a
   href="http://potatogenome.net">Potato Genome Sequence
   Consortium</a> (PGSC), an international group of scientists from 14
   countries. The sequence was published in <a
   href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21743474">Nature</a> in
   July 2011. Many potato lines are tetraploid; however, the sequenced
   accession was a homozygous diploid line (double haploid) <i>Solanum
   tuberosum phureja</i>. Below is a mirror of the files provided on
   <a href="http://potatogenome.net">http://potatogenome.net</a>.)

</div>

<&| /page/info_section.mas,
      title       => '序列數據集(Sequence datasets)',
      collapsible => 1,
 &>
  <& /genomes/default/genome_builds.mas, %ARGS &>
</&>


<&| /page/info_section.mas,
      title       => '可瀏覽的註釋(Browsable annotations)',
      collapsible => 1,
      hide_if_empty => 1,
 &>

  <& /gbrowse/list_sources.mas, organism => $organism &>

</&>

<&| /page/info_section.mas,
      title       => '註釋數據集(Annotation datasets)',
      collapsible => 1,
      hide_if_empty => 1,
 &>

  <& /genomes/default/annotation_sets.mas, %ARGS &>

</&>
